Use MAX_STATIC_DATA of 500000.
When play begins, seed the random-number generator with 1234.

container is a kind of thing.
door is a kind of thing.
object-like is a kind of thing.
supporter is a kind of thing.
food is a kind of object-like.
key is a kind of object-like.
containers are openable, lockable and fixed in place. containers are usually closed.
door is openable and lockable.
object-like is portable.
supporters are fixed in place.
food is edible.
A room has a text called internal name.


The r_1 and the r_2 and the r_11 and the r_10 and the r_12 and the r_9 and the r_14 and the r_15 and the r_17 and the r_16 and the r_18 and the r_4 and the r_6 and the r_5 and the r_7 and the r_8 and the r_0 and the r_13 and the r_19 and the r_3 are rooms.

Understand "laundromat" as r_1.
The internal name of r_1 is "laundromat".
The printed name of r_1 is "-= Laundromat =-".
The laundromat part 0 is some text that varies. The laundromat part 0 is "Well, here we are in a laundromat. The room is well lit.

 You can see a cabinet. Classic TextWorld.[if c_0 is open and there is something in the c_0] The cabinet contains [a list of things in the c_0]. I mean, just wow! Isn't TextWorld just the best?[end if]".
The laundromat part 1 is some text that varies. The laundromat part 1 is "[if c_0 is open and the c_0 contains nothing] What a letdown! The cabinet is empty![end if]".
The laundromat part 2 is some text that varies. The laundromat part 2 is " You smell an interesting smell, and follow it to a counter. [if there is something on the s_0]On the counter you see [a list of things on the s_0]. Huh, weird.[end if]".
The laundromat part 3 is some text that varies. The laundromat part 3 is "[if there is nothing on the s_0]But the thing hasn't got anything on it. Silly counter, silly, empty, good for nothing counter.[end if]".
The laundromat part 4 is some text that varies. The laundromat part 4 is "

There is an unblocked exit to the east. You don't like doors? Why not try going south, that entranceway is unblocked. There is an unguarded exit to the west.".
The description of r_1 is "[laundromat part 0][laundromat part 1][laundromat part 2][laundromat part 3][laundromat part 4]".

